  "description": "The Geekvape Aegis Legend 3 marks a revolutionary step forward in subohm vaping technology, refining the already legendary Aegis series into an even more advanced and intuitive device combining rugged durability with advanced functionality. Boasting an IP68 rating, this kit is crafted to withstand water, dust, and shocks, making it an ideal companion for the adventurous vaper. The device is powered by two 18650 batteries (sold separately) and can fire up to 200W, accommodating a wide range of vaping preferences. With the innovative AS 4.0 chipset at its heart, the Aegis Legend 3 offers multiple vaping modes, including temperature control and a smart mode that auto-adjusts settings to suit your vaping style. The integrated memory mode saves your favorite settings for quick access. Its ergonomic design is enhanced by a 0.96-inch TFT color display , providing easy navigation and adjustments. A thrilling new development brings palm recognition that unlocks the device as soon as you pick it up, alongside button lock and unlocked modes. The included Z Fli Tank features a 2ml e-liquid capacity with an easy top-fill system and utilizes the latest XM series coils, designed for exceptional flavour and dense vapour production. The tank’s innovative design ensures a leakproof experience and supports both MTL and DTL vaping thanks to its adjustable airflow system. Charge efficiently with its fast Type-C USB port, getting your mod back to full power swiftly. Whether you’re at home or on the go, the Aegis Legend 3 is built to offer a premium vaping experience without compromise. We Recommend using High VG (Sub-Ohm) E-liquid with this Kit. Please Note: Batteries are NOT included with this kit. Please Note: To improve the performance and longevity of your new Coils, always prime them with your chosen e-liquid before inserting into your device 'Priming’ simply means wetting the exposed cotton or similar wicking material with e-liquid before use. This helps prevent dry hits and burning the coil should it fail to soak up e-liquid properly before firing the vape device. Once you've primed your pod, attached it to your device, allow to stand for 5-10 minutes before vaping.",
